   144	## Phase 6.0 — flash-attn on the pod (2026-09-29, 06:16–06:27Z, pod `w7ia3zvxqsvs3g`, GPU 0 only)
   145	
   146	Run statement: `run-statements/pod-flash-attn-setup.md`, which now has a post-run addendum on custody and corrections. Receipts are in `flash-attn-setup-2026-09-29/`; the README has identities and hashes. Codex reviewed them in `codex/verify-flash-attn-r1.md` (APPROVE WITH EDITS), and this section applies those edits.
