   162	**The trunk smoke completed with outliers.** In every comparison, 0.017–0.021 % of present-token elements fall outside `0.02 + 0.02|ref|`. The script reports these differences but asserts no numerical acceptance, so this run does not claim trunk numerical agreement.
   163	
   164	| Comparison (present tokens) | elements | max \|Δ\| | mean \|Δ\| | outside tol |
   165	|---|---|---|---|---|
   166	| compiled flash vs eager flash | 44.3M | 0.0872 | 0.00542 | 0.018 % |
   167	| eager flash vs eager padded SDPA | 44.3M | 0.0805 | 0.00498 | 0.021 % |
   168	| compiled flash vs eager padded SDPA | 44.3M | 0.0775 | 0.00546 | 0.019 % |
   169	| compiled vs eager, second shape (64 rows) | 10.9M | 0.0872 | 0.00542 | 0.017 % |
   170	
